A: <p>You have defined constants and then called them as variables. That's the mistake. DB_USER, DB_PASSWORD, DB_DATABASE, DB_HOST are constants and should be used like: DB_USER and not $DB_USER.</p>

<p>Also I recommend declaring them using quotes like this:</p>

<pre><code>define ("DB_USER", "BetaPoints");
</code></pre>

<p>Then also, as another user commented first, mysql_selectdb syntax is wrong. The correct syntax is mysql_select_db ("db_name");</p>


